msgstr "Sensible"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/suggest-config-sidebar.phtml:64
msgid "Recreate the suggest index"
msgstr "Recréer l’index des suggestions"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/suggest-config-sidebar.phtml:65
msgid "Create the suggest index"
msgstr "Créer l’index de suggestion"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:30
#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:95
msgid "Align the maps"
msgstr "Aligner les index"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:34
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:35
msgid ""
"The audit reports the maps that would be created or removed, and the fields "
"used by a config that cannot be mapped, for example a name that is neither a "
"property nor an index."
msgstr ""
"L’audit répertorie les index qui seraient créés ou supprimés ainsi que les "
"champs utilisés par une configuration qui ne peuvent pas être alignés, par "
"exemple un nom qui n’est ni une propriété ni un index."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:47
msgid "Sources of the properties to map"
msgstr "Sources des propriétés à aligner"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:48
msgid ""
"The maps are created for the union of the checked sources. System maps are "
"always kept and a snapshot is taken before each alignment, so the previous "
"configuration can be restored."
msgstr ""
"Les index sont créés pour l’ensemble des sources choisies. Les index système "
"sont toujours conservés et un instantané est créé avant chaque alignement "
"afin de les restaurer si besoin."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:60
msgid "Exact indexes"
msgstr "Index exacts"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:61
msgid ""
"A property with more distinct values than this limit gets no exact index "
"(_ss): such a facet or filter is unusable. A property used by a facet or a "
"filter of a search page keeps its index anyway. Set 0 to skip this check."
msgstr ""
"Une propriété dont le nombre de valeurs distinctes dépasse cette limite ne "
"se voit pas attribuer d’index exact (_ss) : une telle facette ou filtre est "
"inutilisable. Une propriété utilisée par une facette ou un filtre d’une page "
"de recherche conserve toutefois son index. Définissez la valeur 0 pour "
"ignorer cette vérification."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:64
msgid "Maximum number of distinct values"
msgstr "Nombre maximal de valeurs distinctes"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:71
msgid "Multilingual values"
msgstr "Valeurs multilingues"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:72
msgid ""
"Add a language index by property and language, for example "
"dcterms_subject_fr_ss and dcterms_subject_en_ss. Used only when the sites "
"have at least two distinct locales and the property has values in at least "
"two of these languages. The values without language are included in each "
"language index."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un index par propriété et par langue, par exemple "
"dcterms_subject_fr_ss et dcterms_subject_en_ss. À utiliser uniquement "
"lorsque les sites comportent au moins deux langues et que les propriétés ont "
"des valeurs dans au moins deux de ces langues. Les valeurs sans indication "
"de langue sont inclues dans chaque index."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:77
msgid "Support of multilingual values"
msgstr "Prendre en charge les valeurs multilingues"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:83
msgid "Unused maps"
msgstr "Alignements inutilisés"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:84
msgid ""
"Remove the property maps not referenced by the checked sources. Customized "
"maps are kept."
msgstr ""
"Supprimer les index de propriété non référencés par les sources. Les index "
"personnalisés sont conservés."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:89
msgid "Remove unused maps automatically"
msgstr "Supprimer les alignements inutilisés automatiquement"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:104
#, php-format
msgid "Map snapshots (%d)"
msgstr "Sauvegarde des alignements (%d)"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:105
msgid ""
"A snapshot is taken before each maps alignment. Only the 20 most recent "
"snapshots are kept on this core."
msgstr ""
"Un instantané est pris avant chaque synchronisation. Les 20 derniers sont "
"conservés."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:120
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d maps · %2$s"
msgstr "%1$d index · %2$s"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:125
msgid ""
"Restore this snapshot: the current maps are replaced (the current state is "
"snapshotted first)."
msgstr ""
"Restaurer cet instantané : les alignements actuels seront remplacés, après "
"sauvegarde de l’état actuel."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:126
msgid ""
"Restore this snapshot? Current maps will be replaced. The current state is "
"itself snapshotted before restore."
msgstr ""
"Restaurer cet instantané ? Les alignements actuels seront remplacés. L’état "
"actuel est lui-même sauvegardé avant la restauration."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:131
msgid "Delete this snapshot"
msgstr "Supprimer cette sauvegarde"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/sync-maps-sidebar.phtml:132
msgid "Delete this snapshot?"
msgstr "Supprimer cette sauvegarde ?"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/unfreeze-maps-sidebar.phtml:20
msgid "Manage the manual maps automatically"
msgstr "Gérer automatiquement les index manuels"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/unfreeze-maps-sidebar.phtml:25
msgid ""
"A map created or edited by hand is flagged as manual, so the alignment never "
"removes it nor updates it. A map with no flag but with customized settings, "
"a specific formatter, a pool filter, a boost or a renamed index, is "
"protected the same way, since such settings mean it was edited by hand too."
msgstr ""
"Un index créé ou modifié manuellement est marqué « manuel » et n’est donc "
"jamais supprimé ni mis à jour par la synchronisation. Un index sans marque "
"mais personnalisé avec un formateur spécifique, un filtre, une pondération "
"ou un index renommé est protégée comme un index manuel."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/unfreeze-maps-sidebar.phtml:26
msgid ""
"Giving these maps back to the alignment makes them follow its sources again, "
"and the ones used by no config become removable."
msgstr ""
"Le fait de marquer ces index comme alignés permet de les gérer "
"automatiquement et ceux sans config pourront être supprimés."

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/unfreeze-maps-sidebar.phtml:28
msgid "Manage them automatically"
msgstr "Les gérer automatiquement"

#: view/search-solr/admin/core/unfreeze-maps-sidebar.phtml:33
msgid ""
"Every map of this core is already managed by the alignment: there is nothing "
"to do."
msgstr ""
"Rien à faire : tous les index de ce cœur sont déjà gérés par les alignements."

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/add.phtml:51
msgid "Add map"
msgstr "Ajouter un index"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/edit.phtml:52
msgid "Edit map"
msgstr "Modifier l’index"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:94
msgid "Metadata to extract from Omeka"
msgstr "Métadonnée à extraire depuis Omeka"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:99
msgid "Index only some values from this source"
msgstr "N’indexer que certaines valeurs de cette source"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:105
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Langues"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:117
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Destination"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:125
msgid "Adapt the metadata"
msgstr "Adapter les métadonnées"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:132
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Paramètres avancés"

#: view/search-solr/admin/map/form.phtml:143
msgid "Extraction"
msgstr "Extraction"

